msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was the only thing keeping my broken self from falling apart completely. ⟪k:1⟫Yet she "
"claimed not to remember me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était la seule chose qui empêchait mon âme brisée de se dissoudre totalement. ⟪k:1⟫Et "
"pourtant, elle disait ne pas se souvenir de moi."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7E405E73_9B4D_43A5_8BB6_676F78E81FCF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
